OL,3,GNEWSATribute to 'caring and funny'
OL,4,Awoman hit by taxi
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a woman who died after
OL,7,Fbeing hit by a taxi have described her
OL,8,Fas a "loving" and "deeply loved"
OL,9,Fdaughter, sister and aunt.
OL,11,FIsobel Reyland, 26, who was known as
OL,12,FIzzy, from South Wales, was struck by a
OL,13,Fwhite Toyota Voxy private hire taxi on
OL,14,FAigburth Road in Liverpool at about
OL,15,F17:40 BST on 2 September.
OL,17,FIn a tribute, her family said she was a
OL,18,F"beautiful, caring, funny and loving
OL,19,Fyoung lady" who had been following her
OL,20,Fdreams in a city she loved.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
